      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I have this happen if my wireless Vive Pro loses tracking/connection.  Of note is it seems to just disable world audio rather than break it outright.  \n\nEg;  If a video player is playing video, it will go mute on the headset re-awakening, but if I pause and resume the video it will regain audio.",
